    "title": "IS 2062 E350 Steel Plates: The Ideal Choice for Heavy Machinery",
    "originalUrl": "https://ferrite.in/blog/is-2062-e350-steel-plates-heavy-machinery/",
    "publishedDate": "2026-06-17T14:31:16",
